<http://data.silknow.org/object/fd05a37a-156e-3418-959d-0ce1490fbcd3>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Rectangular panel, made up of many fragments. Weft twill ground fabric with linen warp and cotton weft. Pattern, embroidered with blue (faded from green) crewels in brick, chain and other stitches, shows undulating branches and large scale leaves with prominent veins, rendered as shaded outlines. Very fragmentary condition; pieces mounted on all-cotton weft twill ground."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a326583f-2e34-317e-ad8f-e83ef119e50e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/004884bd-b9d7-395b-a423-dc1a2c413404> ;
